 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Obligation",
     "texto": [
      "**Trebuie să fac curat** means «I have to clean». Unlike English, it is not followed by the infinitive: we say, literally, «it is necessary that I clean».",
      "**A face curat**, **a spăla vasele** and **a pune masa** are common expressions that are worth learning in full."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tasks and forms",
     "texto": [
      "**A găti** is «to cook» and **a șterge praful**, «to dust». The pronoun is not used with tasks that have an object: **spăl vasele** («I wash the dishes»), but **mă spăl** («I wash myself»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
